Subject: Enable original material light modes and projected-shadow stages through Aurora
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

The selected ScrollingDiffuse and MaskedSpecularFresnel programs can now use the
original vertex, doubled, ramp and projected-shadow branches with validated
native lighting inputs. Preserve material flags and original TEV recipes.
Load a native light-ramp binding only when that mode requests it. View/time inputs
remain explicitly scoped until the original GLView and stadium graph is linked.

